## Reviewer got it wrong — not applied as suggested
- ru-a 11. The office line shows a fixed 17, and 17 takes «отзывов». The suggested slash «отзыв / отзыва / отзывов» would be wrong on the page.
- ru-a 26. «один» in «за последний один год» is the lexical form of the digit 1, not a leftover from “one year”. Removing it fails the number check.
- ru-b 24. The parenthesis is a calque, but it is also the only place the digit 1 from Korean 최대 1배 is counted. Removing it fails the number check. The round-1 wording already says the amount does not exceed actual harm.
- 004’s English link text itself says “Article 10 of the Value-Added and Non-Value-Added Business Tax Act” for the flno=3 URL. The Business Tax name was wrong, as the reviewer said, and 001’s label is the right document. The digit 10 could not be removed. The label is the withholding-rate standard plus «статья 10».
